    "text": "<p>The total number of chiral compound/s from the following is</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0152_aff404fb5a2c.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 686px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Following points are to be remembered when checking for chirality in a compound:<br />1.Compound should have a stereogenic centre.<br />2. Compound shouldn&#39;t have any plane&nbsp;of symmetry as it can convert a chiral compound to a meso compound.<br />Based on the above two facts, out of the following, only 2 are chiral compounds:<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0152_d65041f215b5.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 232px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0152_88fb02036b55.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 273px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0152_92dbfa52fc89.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 286px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  }
